<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      In view of Proposition <a href="/tag/B62F20" data-tag="B62F20">4.4.2.6</a>, it suffices to prove that $\SSet ^{\tau }$ is stable under pullbacks and $\kappa $-small products. Using Theorem <a href="/tag/EB2834" data-tag="EB2834">4.2.4.1</a>, it will suffice to show that the full subcategory of $\Kan $ spanned by essentially $\tau $-small spaces is stable under $\kappa $-small products and homotopy fiber products. This follows immediately from characterization $(1)$ given in Proposition <a href="/tag/283537" data-tag="283537">5.4.1.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
